  "plain": "Varginha is a town in Brazil where, people say, a strange creature was captured in 1996, and the documentary filmmaker James Fox says his film Moment of Contact brings out new testimony about it. Fox tells Michels he interviewed two forensic pathologists, the chief of police, a new crash witness and the lead neurosurgeon at the regional hospital, Italo Venturelli. If they are right, the case points to a living being held by the authorities and treated in a hospital."
